cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or build on these findings, please cite it."
title: "Leak-free transfer learning for next-day PM2.5 forecasting at newly deployed stations"
abstract: >-
  A deployment-realistic, tail-aware evaluation of multi-source transfer learning
  for next-day PM2.5 forecasting at newly deployed air-quality stations in Abu
  Dhabi. Pooled linear transfer beats persistence on ordinary days at every target
  station but is worse on the extreme-pollution days that matter, and added model
  capacity (LSTM, gradient boosting) does not help.
type: software

